WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.406 --> 00:00:06.360
- I am Leah Chase, chef and co-owner

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.693
of Dooky Chase's Restaurant.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.987
I'm 94 years old.

00:00:13.109 --> 00:00:15.776
I been in this kitchen 71 years.

00:00:17.336 --> 00:00:19.320
Every day I come in this kitchen.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.011
7:30 in the morning, I hit this floor,

00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:24.971
and I don't leave until we close.

00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:28.629
When guests come to this city,
they know when they come here

00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:31.379
they're gonna a good bowl of creole gumbo,

00:00:31.379 --> 00:00:33.168
they're gonna get some jambalaya,

00:00:33.168 --> 00:00:36.560
they're gonna get some good fried chicken,

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.315
they're gonna get what I serve.

00:00:39.315 --> 00:00:41.259
The butter just melts
in there and gives it

00:00:41.259 --> 00:00:43.342
all kinds of good flavor.

00:00:49.301 --> 00:00:51.501
Every day, I meet new people,

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:55.349
and they come to taste the food I cook.

00:00:55.349 --> 00:00:57.432
That makes you feel good.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.659
This place, back in the
day, was a landmark.

00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:06.139
We became a meeting place in
the Civil Rights Movement,

00:01:06.139 --> 00:01:09.309
and so you had always Thurgood
Marshall, Ernest Wright,

00:01:09.309 --> 00:01:11.059
all the NAACP people.

00:01:12.101 --> 00:01:14.469
Black people knew they
could come to Dooky Chase's

00:01:14.469 --> 00:01:17.821
and would not be disturbed by anybody.

00:01:17.821 --> 00:01:20.759
It was illegal for whites
and blacks to be together,

00:01:20.759 --> 00:01:22.570
but they came here.

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:25.737
This was the safe haven for all of us.

00:01:27.741 --> 00:01:29.074
I fed Mr. Obama.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:34.187
He was gonna eat the gumbo,
and he gets a hot sauce bottle.

00:01:35.119 --> 00:01:36.549
Oh my god.

00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:40.716
I said, "Mr. Obama, you don't
put hot sauce in my gumbo".

00:01:41.618 --> 00:01:43.770
Now, that gets around
all the neighborhood,

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.970
and so they said, "You
told him good, Ms. Dooky.

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:51.137
"Don't be messing up your gumbo". (laughs)

00:01:52.341 --> 00:01:54.269
I was recognized by James Beard

00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:56.981
with the Lifetime Achievement Award.

00:01:56.981 --> 00:01:59.839
To me, that was unbelievable.

00:01:59.839 --> 00:02:02.821
Sometimes I said, "I
don't know how I got here,

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:06.170
"but it gives you energy to keep going,"

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:09.778
and my whole thing is to
make this restaurant go.

00:02:09.778 --> 00:02:13.778
I wanna be one of the
best restaurants there is.

